# Files that must not reach a deployment.
#
# Vercel turns EVERY file under `api/` into a Serverless Function unless its
# name starts with `_`. That silently included the colocated test files, so a
# repository with 7 endpoints was deploying 14 functions — and the Hobby plan
# allows 12. Phase 18.4 added the seventh endpoint and its test, crossed the
# line, and the deployment failed with nothing in the diff that looked like a
# deployment concern.
#
# The count is the reason this file exists, but not the only one: a test file
# deployed as a function is a public route. `/api/session.test` answering
# anything at all is not a thing anyone asked for.
#
# Consequence worth knowing: these files are not uploaded, so the Vercel build
# does not typecheck them. `npm run typecheck` and CI still do, on the whole
# tree — that is where an api test's types are checked.
api/*.test.ts
api/**/*.test.ts
